<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Umbono cautions it in talks.</title>
<headline>Umbono cautions it in talks.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Umbono Investment Corp Ltd said on Wednesday that it was involved in talks, which if successful, may have an effect on its share price.</p>
<p>Shareholders were advised to exercise caution in their sharedealings.</p>
<p>No further details were given in the brief announcement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
